  "title": "Buying a train ticket",
  "text": "Buying a train ticket from the machine\n\n1. Touch the screen to start.\n2. Choose your language: English, Polish or German.\n3. Choose where you want to go.\n4. Choose \"single\" (one way) or \"return\" (there and back).\n5. Choose the number of tickets.\n6. Pay by card or with coins. The machine doesn't take notes.\n7. Take your ticket and your change.\n\nKeep your ticket with you on the train. The ticket inspector can ask to see it.",
